%SIXMD 1
# @?RM - UNLINK FILES

## DESCRIPTION

UNLINKS FILES. -F IGNORES MISSING OR UNLINKABLE INPUTS.

USAGE IS 'RM [-F] FILE ...'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/RM
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/RM.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

